{title: 077 - O Love of God Most Full}
{subtitle: SDA Hymnal #077 • VANDEMAN • S.M.}
{lyricist: Oscar Clute}
{composer: Gordon Young}
{key: F}
{time: 4/4}
{tempo: Moderato}
{meta: hymn_number 77}
{meta: tune VANDEMAN}
{meta: meter S.M.}
{meta: category God the Father - }

{start_of_verse: Verse 1}
[F]O love [Bb/D]of God most [C7]full,
[C]O [F]love of [Bb]God [Dm]most [C]free,
[F]Come [Dm]warm my [Am]heart,come [Bb]fill [C7]my soul,
[F/A]Come [Gm]lead [Dm/A]me [Gm/Bb]unto [F]Thee.
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: Verse 2}
[F]Warm as [Bb/D]the glowing [C7]sun
[C]So shines [F/A]Thy [Bb]love [Dm]on [C]me,
[F]It [Dm]wraps me [Am]'round with [Bb]kindly [C7]care,
[F/A]It [Gm]draws [Dm/A]me [Gm/Bb]unto [F]Thee.
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: Verse 3}
[F]The wildest [Bb]sea is [C7]calm,
[C]The [F]tempest [Bb]brings [Dm]no [C]fear,
[F]The [Dm]darkest [Am]night is [Bb]full [C7]of light,
[F/A]Because [Dm/A]Thy [Gm/Bb]love [C7]is [F]near.
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: Verse 4}
[F]O love [Bb/D]of God most [C7]full,
[C]O [F]love of [Bb]God [Dm]most [C]free,
[F]It [Dm]warms my [Am]heart, it [Bb]fills [C7]my soul,
[F/A]With [Gm]might [Dm/A]it [Gm/Bb]strengthens [F]me.
{end_of_verse}
